      <p>格式有<bold>粗体</bold>、<italic>斜体</italic>、<underline>下划线</underline>、<strike>删除线</strike>、上标<sup>2</sup>、下标<sub>i</sub>，嵌套<bold><italic><underline>粗斜下划线</underline></italic></bold>，变量<named-content content-type="variable">x<sup>2</sup><sub>i</sub></named-content>，调用<inline-code>init(&amp;ctx)</inline-code>，加粗代码<bold><inline-code>ls</inline-code></bold>。参照<std><std-ref>GB/T 1.1—2020</std-ref></std>、加粗的<bold><std><std-ref>GB/T 20000.1</std-ref></std></bold>，另见<mixed-citation>Example Corp. Interface specification</mixed-citation>、<mixed-citation><italic>《计量法》</italic></mixed-citation>，访问<ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://example.org/">示例网站</ext-link>与<ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="mailto:sac@example.org"><bold>邮件</bold></ext-link>。脚注内容<xref ref-type="fn" rid="fn_1">1)</xref><fn id="fn_1"><label><sup>1)</sup></label><p>正文脚注的内容。</p></fn>；强制换行：第一行<break/>第二行，加粗换行<bold>甲</bold><break/><bold>乙</bold>。</p>
